//RS // Live semantic tier for `jet os import` (D-JOS-NIXIMPORT1=C): when the
//RS // source is a flake root with no `jetos-import-facts.json`, evaluate the
//RS // host's NixOS configuration through `nix eval --json … --apply` and build
//RS // the import plan from real option values. Facts a jetos option cannot
//RS // express become explicit omissions — never silent drops.
//RS 
//RS /// The `--apply` extractor. Runs over the evaluated NixOS `config` with
//RS /// builtins only (`lib` is not in scope under `--apply`); every optional
//RS /// path is `or`-guarded so hosts without a subsystem still evaluate.
